=== distance flown during one latency (m) ===
V [m/s] |     10 ms     50 ms    100 ms    500 ms   1000 ms
     20 |       0.2       1.0       2.0      10.0      20.0
     60 |       0.6       3.0       6.0      30.0      60.0
    150 |       1.5       7.5      15.0      75.0     150.0
